/// A description of a tag. Every tag is a key-value pair. You can add up to
/// 50 tags to a single DAX cluster. Amazon Web Services-assigned tag names
/// and values are automatically assigned the aws: prefix, which the user
/// cannot assign. Amazon Web Services-assigned tag names do not count
/// towards the tag limit of 50. User-assigned tag names have the prefix
/// user: . You cannot backdate the application of a tag.
pub struct Tag {
  /// The key for the tag. Tag keys are case sensitive. Every DAX cluster can
  /// only have one tag with the same key. If you try to add an existing tag
  /// (same key), the existing tag value will be updated to the new value.
  pub key: Str? = None
  /// The value of the tag. Tag values are case-sensitive and can be null.
  pub value: Str? = None
}

/// The tag does not exist.
